#: src/Support/I18n.php:466
msgid ""
"Enter the <strong>Destination URL</strong> above (it must be HTTPS) and "
"<strong>Save</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Gib oben die <strong>Ziel-URL</strong> ein (sie muss HTTPS sein) und "
"<strong>speichere</strong>."

#: src/Support/I18n.php:467
